@base = http://localhost:8000/api/v1
@token = paste-parent-access-token
@student = 1
@main = 1
@savings = 2
@card = 1

### My data (JSON)
GET {{base}}/privacy/my-data/
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### My data (CSV download)
GET {{base}}/privacy/my-data/?format=csv
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Data request (export | correction | deletion; subject self | student)
POST {{base}}/privacy/data-requests/
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "request_type": "correction", "subject": "student", "student": {{student}}, "details": "Date of birth is wrong" }

### My requests and their status
GET {{base}}/privacy/data-requests/
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
